 core: `Pluto opposes Neptune across 180 degrees, maximum distance between transformation and transcendence. The planet that demands death-and-rebirth and the planet that dissolves boundaries are at full polarity. Pluto reaches for power through total destruction; Neptune reaches for power through mystical dissolution. The opposition holds both as equally legitimate forces pulling in opposite directions. This aspect produces oscillation between transformative intensity and spiritual transcendence, between change through depth and change through mysticism.`,
