 sonic: `Pluto's transformative intensity and Neptune's dissolving transcendence operate from opposite harmonic poles in the opposition. Pluto's concentrated depth is answered by Neptune's boundary-blurring from maximum distance. The result is music where transformation and transcendence are in dialogue across the polarity. The harmonic language alternates between profound intensity and mystical ambiguity. The rhythm is both concentrated and flowing, two pulses in opposition. Listen for the quality of music where death-and-rebirth and dissolution are opposed, both present at full strength but never merging.`,
 core_synastry: `Pluto opposite Neptune between these charts means one person's transformative principle and the other person's transcendent principle are at maximum distance. Death-and-rebirth and mysticism are geometrically opposed.`,
 behavioral_synastry: `When one person's Pluto demands total transformation, the other person's Neptune wants spiritual transcendence. The opposition means both forms of spiritual power are legitimate but geometrically incompatible. These relationships work when both people recognize that transformation and mysticism are different spiritual paths and the opposition between them is structural.`,
 friendship_synastry: `One friend's Pluto opposes the other friend's Neptune across 180 degrees. Transformative intensity and spiritual transcendence are at full polarity. These friendships work when both friends accept that depth and mysticism are both valid forms of spiritual power.`,
 romantic_synastry: `One partner's Pluto stands opposite the other's Neptune. Change through transformation and change through transcendence are at maximum distance. What one person experiences as necessary depth, the other experiences as preventing spiritual surrender. What one person experiences as liberating mysticism, the other experiences as avoiding necessary transformation. The work is holding both forms of spiritual power without forcing them to merge when the geometry keeps them opposed.`,
 core_transit: `Transiting Pluto opposes your natal Neptune across 180 degrees, maximum distance between transformation and transcendence. What demands death-and-rebirth and what dissolves boundaries are pulling in opposite directions during this multi-decade period. The opposition holds both as equally real. This produces oscillation between Plutonian intensity and Neptunian mysticism.`,
