 behavioral_transit: `Transforming feels spiritually attuned during this extended window. What you're destroying and what you're dissolving boundaries toward aren't in competition. Pluto's intensity includes your Neptunian mysticism naturally. Use this for long-term spiritual practices that need both death-and-rebirth and transcendence, transformations where depth and mystical dissolution support each other, power that includes spiritual dimension. The trine makes spiritual transformation available but won't push you toward the edge of total surrender. Use this for deepening existing spiritual work rather than the dissolution that requires releasing all foundation.`,
