 core_transit: `Transiting Pluto forms a sextile to your natal Neptune, 60 degrees of productive cooperation. What demands transformation and what dissolves boundaries are operating in compatible modes during this multi-decade period. Your transformative principle and your mystical principle have breathing room from each other. Pluto can destroy what's obsolete without your Neptune immediately demanding total dissolution, and your Neptune can transcend without Pluto requiring complete death. This is access to flexible spiritual power where intensity and mysticism support each other productively.`,
 behavioral_transit: `Transforming and transcending feel compatible during this extended window rather than opposed. What you're destroying and what you're dissolving boundaries toward can support each other without one dominating. Use this for spiritual practices that need both depth and transcendence applied at appropriate moments, power that includes both transformation and mysticism but not fighting, spiritual work that happens in productive sequence rather than competing simultaneously. The sextile makes cooperation available but won't manufacture genuine capacity for transformation where attachment to what exists still dominates or create mystical capacity where only Plutonian intensity operates without spiritual dimension.`,
